  "notes": "{固|かた}める is an ichidan verb meaning to harden, solidify, or strengthen.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Pair: {固|かた}まる (intransitive, to harden)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {決意|けつい}を{固|かた}める: to firm up one's resolve\n- {守|まも}りを{固|かた}める: to strengthen defense\n- {足元|あしもと}を{固|かた}める: to secure one's footing\n- {土|つち}を{固|かた}める: to pack the soil\n- {身|み}を{固|かた}める: to settle down (get married)\n\nRELATED ADJECTIVE:\n{固|かた}い: hard, solid, firm",
